**Accelerate possibilities** . The WSP Data Center CoE (Center of Excellence) is growing, and we’re looking for smart, responsive, collaborative people to join us. Our CoE is 100% focused on data centers—supporting the world’s leading AI and cloud infrastructure companies. You’ll work to help tackle our clients’ biggest challenges: Where to build? How to secure power and water? How to develop responsibly and become a valued part of the community? AI is transforming life from scientific discoveries to smarter transportation and more sustainable communities. Data centers make it possible.

With us, you can build impact, deliver remarkable projects, and grow your career while shaping the future of the data center industry.

**This Opportunity**
--------------------

WSP is currently initiating a search for a **Project Manager.** As a Project Manager with us, you will lead a diverse group of engineers from project initiation through completion with minimal oversight. This includes regular communications and coordination with clients, managing expectations, writing, and managing proposals, creating change orders, composing budgets, invoicing and project closeout.

**Your Impact**
---------------

* Lead teams of Engineers, Designers and other staff through project completion;
* Lead the teams through the successful completion of medium to large projects while managing more than one project at a time;
* Prepare project work plans, proposals, and schedules, and obtain management/client approval;
* Maintain regular communication with clients regarding project status and project quality, and proactively resolve issues;
